      "role": "user",
      "content": "so if the impact was that bad for so many people, wouldn't it be more accurate to say the TPP was just a failed policy for the average american worker? like, if the \"benefits\" only went to specific niche sectors and agriculture, does that not make it a net failure for the working class as a whole?",
